  "details": "Sometimes I hide other peoples avatars because I wanted to take a picture without them\n\nThere's a feature to hide local or global avatars, but I want to be able to hide like one guy  and show the rest. When I hide an avatar, it still shows up in the camera as a robot.\n\nI think this is just a suggestion to remove the robots from the camera view, but maybe some people want to have them still visible?\n\nMaybe have a setting to show robots when avatars are hidden, but it's disabled by default.",
